Spec: Experimental Android caller snapshot

Purpose:
  Inspect current package identity for a single-package Binder UID without granting permissions.

Owns:
  ./CallerIdentity.java

Must:
  Obtain package names from PackageManager and verify package UID equals the captured calling UID.
  Reject multiple packages, declared shared UID, missing signatures or inconsistent repeated identity snapshots.
  Include current signer digests, available signing history and first-install time in an internal immutable identity key.
  Keep package names, certificates and UID out of public responses.

Must not:
  Treat the snapshot as approved registration, signing-lineage authorization or validated shared-UID support.
